{"seq":3,"slug":"orm-and-query-builders","title":"ORM 与查询构建器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/integration/orm-and-query-builders","wordCount":623,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"orm-与查询构建器\">ORM 与查询构建器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在 SQLite 之上，TypeScript/Node.js 生态提供了不同抽象层级的工具：从<strong>原生 SQL</strong>（better-sqlite3）到<strong>查询构建器</strong>（Kysely）再到<strong>ORM</strong>（Drizzle、Prisma）。抽象层级越高，类型安全与开发效率越好，但对 SQL 的精细控制和 SQLite 特有能力的利用就越受限。选型的本质，是在这几者之间按项目需求取平衡。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工具选型概览\">工具选型概览</h2><p>在 TypeScript/Node.js 生态中，有多种 ORM 和查询构建器支持 SQLite。选择合适的工具需要权衡类型安全、查询灵活性、SQLite 特性支持和学习曲线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 抽象层级&#10;        RAW[原生 SQL&lt;br/&gt;better-sqlite3]&#10;        QB[查询构建器&lt;br/&gt;Kysely]&#10;        ORM_LIGHT[轻量 ORM&lt;br/&gt;Drizzle]&#10;        ORM_FULL[全功能 ORM&lt;br/&gt;Prisma]&#10;    end&#10;    RAW --&gt;|灵活性最高&lt;br/&gt;类型安全最低| QB&#10;    QB --&gt;|平衡| ORM_LIGHT&#10;    ORM_LIGHT --&gt;|抽象层高&lt;br/&gt;类型安全高| ORM_FULL\">graph TD\n    subgraph 抽象层级\n        RAW[原生 SQL&lt;br/&gt;better-sqlite3]\n        QB[查询构建器&lt;br/&gt;Kysely]\n        ORM_LIGHT[轻量 ORM&lt;br/&gt;Drizzle]\n        ORM_FULL[全功能 ORM&lt;br/&gt;Prisma]\n    end\n    RAW --&gt;|灵活性最高&lt;br/&gt;类型安全最低| QB\n    QB --&gt;|平衡| ORM_LIGHT\n    ORM_LIGHT --&gt;|抽象层高&lt;br/&gt;类型安全高| ORM_FULL</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>类型安全</th>\n<th>SQLite 支持</th>\n<th>迁移工具</th>\n<th>学习曲线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Drizzle</td>\n<td>轻量 ORM</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kysely</td>\n<td>查询构建器</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prisma</td>\n<td>全功能 ORM</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"drizzle-orm\">Drizzle ORM</h2><p><strong>Drizzle</strong> 是一个 TypeScript-first 的轻量级 ORM，提供类型安全的 SQL 查询构建，同时保留了对原生 SQL 的完全控制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { sqliteTable, text, integer } from &#39;drizzle-orm/sqlite-core&#39;;&#10;import { drizzle } from &#39;drizzle-orm/better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;import { eq, gt, and, sql } from &#39;drizzle-orm&#39;;&#10;import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;&#10;const users = sqliteTable(&#39;users&#39;, {&#10;  id: integer(&#39;id&#39;).primaryKey({ autoIncrement: true }),&#10;  name: text(&#39;name&#39;).notNull(),&#10;  email: text(&#39;email&#39;).notNull().unique(),&#10;  age: integer(&#39;age&#39;),&#10;  city: text(&#39;city&#39;),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const sqlite = new Database(&#39;myapp.db&#39;);&#10;const db = drizzle(sqlite);&#10;&#10;const allUsers = db.select().from(users).all();&#10;&#10;const filteredUsers = db&#10;  .select()&#10;  .from(users)&#10;  .where(and(eq(users.city, &#39;北京&#39;), gt(users.age, 25)))&#10;  .all();&#10;&#10;db.insert(users)&#10;  .values({&#10;    name: &#39;Alice&#39;,&#10;    email: &#39;alice@example.com&#39;,&#10;    age: 30,&#10;    city: &#39;上海&#39;,&#10;  })&#10;  .run();&#10;&#10;db.update(users).set({ age: 31 }).where(eq(users.id, 1)).run();&#10;&#10;db.delete(users).where(eq(users.id, 1)).run();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { sqliteTable, text, integer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'drizzle-orm/sqlite-core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { drizzle } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'drizzle-orm/better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { eq, gt, and, sql } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'drizzle-orm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> users</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sqliteTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">primaryKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ autoIncrement: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">notNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  email: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'email'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">notNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  age: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'age'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  city: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'city'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sqlite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'myapp.db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> drizzle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sqlite);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> allUsers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> filteredUsers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users.city, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'北京'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users.age, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    city: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'上海'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users.id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(users.id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Drizzle 的迁移工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { migrate } from &#39;drizzle-orm/better-sqlite3/migrator&#39;;&#10;&#10;migrate(db, { migrationsFolder: &#39;./drizzle&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { migrate } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'drizzle-orm/better-sqlite3/migrator'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">migrate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db, { migrationsFolder: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./drizzle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"kysely\">Kysely</h2><p><strong>Kysely</strong> 是一个纯类型安全的 SQL 查询构建器，不是 ORM。它不管理 Schema 定义或数据映射，而是专注于提供类型安全的 SQL 查询构建体验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Kysely, SqliteDialect } from &#39;kysely&#39;;&#10;import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface DB {&#10;  users: {&#10;    id: number;&#10;    name: string;&#10;    email: string;&#10;    age: number | null;&#10;    city: string | null;&#10;  };&#10;  orders: {&#10;    id: number;&#10;    user_id: number;&#10;    total: number;&#10;    status: string;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const db = new Kysely&lt;DB&gt;({&#10;  dialect: new SqliteDialect({&#10;    database: new Database(&#39;myapp.db&#39;),&#10;  }),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const users = await db&#10;  .selectFrom(&#39;users&#39;)&#10;  .select([&#39;id&#39;, &#39;name&#39;, &#39;email&#39;])&#10;  .where(&#39;city&#39;, &#39;=&#39;, &#39;北京&#39;)&#10;  .where(&#39;age&#39;, &#39;&gt;&#39;, 25)&#10;  .orderBy(&#39;name&#39;)&#10;  .execute();&#10;&#10;const result = await db&#10;  .selectFrom(&#39;users&#39;)&#10;  .innerJoin(&#39;orders&#39;, &#39;orders.user_id&#39;, &#39;users.id&#39;)&#10;  .select([&#39;users.name&#39;, db.fn.sum&lt;number&gt;(&#39;orders.total&#39;).as(&#39;total_spent&#39;)])&#10;  .groupBy(&#39;users.name&#39;)&#10;  .having(db.fn.sum(&#39;orders.total&#39;), &#39;&gt;&#39;, 1000)&#10;  .execute();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Kysely, SqliteDialect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'kysely'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;-